  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Tashkurgan CHN</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "Lithinos Pyrgos (now Tashkurgan, Xinjiang in China (\u5854\u4ec0\u5e93\u5c14\u5e72\u9547)) was a settlement located along the Silk Road. During the Han Dynasty the site was a major center of the Kingdom of Puli (\u84b2\u7281).",
